    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You arrive in Cascade Falls with nothing but a backpack and a broken past.</strong><br>A quiet town where secrets linger beneath the surface\u2014and healing never comes easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cascade Falls</i> is a mature, story-driven visual novel that blends slow-burn romance, emotional drama, and branching choices with a sharp dose of humor and heartache. Navigate your new life, build relationships, and face the consequences of who you were\u2014and who you want to become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc94 FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storytelling</strong><br>Follow Steve\u2019s journey of recovery after a devastating betrayal, where every relationship offers hope\u2014or danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Paths &amp; Romance</strong><br>Build trust with a diverse cast of characters. Flirt, fight, fall in love\u2014or screw it all up. Every choice matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Visuals</strong><br>Fully-rendered scenes, dynamic lighting, and cinematic camera work bring every moment to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slice-of-Life Meets Chaos</strong><br>From awkward office moments to late-night gigs and sketchy side jobs, live your second chance in a town full of surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Themes, No Censorship</strong><br>Explore adult relationships, emotional trauma, and realistic intimacy with full narrative freedom.</p></li></ul>",
